ASSUME `an unasked number` IS A NUMBER
ASSUME `an unasked date` IS A DATE
ASSUME `an unasked How I stand to the cat` IS A `How I stand to the cat`
ASSUME `an unasked Offence` IS A `Offence`
ASSUME `an unasked Registration term` IS A `Registration term`
ASSUME `an unasked Where my cat is` IS A `Where my cat is`

